## Observation
Permission Asked/Replied events DO carry sessionID (Replied adds
requestID), so a permission-gated tool call is matchable. But an MCP tool
call's output event shape — whether the SSE frame for the tool RESULT
carries session id + output — was not observed: emitting one needs a model
to invoke the tool. The Director-polls fallback stays undecided.

